 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0 (2025-10-06)
+
+- Ticket assignment: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee` sets an agent (or `null` to unassign); every ticket shows `assignee`.
+- Only open and in-progress tickets can be assigned. The assigned agent is notified through the outbox.
+- `GET /tickets` filters by `assignee` (`assignee=` for unassigned). Filters still combine: a ticket must match every one.
+- The command-line listing shows each ticket's assignee.
+
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
 - The operator command line, `bin/tickets.js` (`list`, `show`), and the weekly report, `scripts/weekly-report.js`.
